strawwu-laptop — StrawWU laptop peripherals meta (POST-HW4)

Curates TLP power management, libinput touchpad, Fn key helpers
(brightnessctl/acpid), fprintd fingerprint login, and PipeWire-compatible
webcam tools. Includes device_profile curation for community PR (Q5).

CLI: strawwu-laptop-peripherals {status|smoke|profiles|version}

See docs/plans/strawwu-hw4-peripherals-plan.md
